{#
  The finder's dataset, served as a file instead of embedded in the page.

  Inlined, these 491 records were 525 KB of JSON sitting in the middle of
  /resources/ — the HTML parser had to chew through all of it before it could
  render anything below, which is what made that page's first paint the
  slowest on the site. As a separate file it is fetched in parallel, cached on
  its own, and compressed by the server.

  Short keys are the compact shape built in src/_data/resources.js:
    n name · d description · u url · p phone
    c categories · l locations · g languages · s prebuilt search haystack
#}
